 "lines": {
  "hook": "A tornado is coming, and you're on the highway.",
  "b1": "An overpass ahead looks like the perfect roof.",
  "b2": "But wind under a bridge is usually faster.",
  "b3": "And you're a sitting target for flying debris.",
  "b4": "Oklahoma, nineteen ninety nine. Winds of about three hundred miles an hour.",
  "b5": "Three people died under or near overpasses.",
  "b6": "Let's drive that road again.",
  "b7": "One. Best is a basement or an inner room, not a car.",
  "b8": "Two. Stuck in the car? Stay buckled, head below the windows.",
  "b9": "Three. Or lie somewhere clearly lower than the road, covering your head.",
  "end": "Rewatch it. That overpass won't look like a roof again."
 },
